From: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: iris: report the DCI-P3 colour primaries of decoded
 streams

iris_hfi_get_v4l2_color_primaries() turns the colour primaries that the
firmware reports for a decoded stream (ITU-T H.273 code points) into a
V4L2 colorspace. Its DCI-P3 case has the label and the return value
swapped: it matches V4L2_COLORSPACE_DCI_P3 (12) and returns
HFI_PRIMARIES_SMPTE_RP431_2 (11). A stream that signals colour primaries
11 (SMPTE RP 431-2, DCI-P3) is therefore reported as
V4L2_COLORSPACE_DEFAULT, and one that signals 12 (SMPTE EG 432-1, the P3
primaries with a D65 white point) as 11, which is V4L2_COLORSPACE_RAW.

Match HFI_PRIMARIES_SMPTE_RP431_2 and return V4L2_COLORSPACE_DCI_P3.
EG 432-1 has no V4L2 colorspace (V4L2_COLORSPACE_DCI_P3 uses the DCI
white point), so it now gets V4L2_COLORSPACE_DEFAULT like the other
primaries without a V4L2 equivalent.

Both decoders call this helper, but on SC8280XP the gen1 decoder does
not reach it. Its firmware puts only the colour primaries code into
HFI_PROPERTY_PARAM_VDEC_COLOUR_SPACE (1 for BT.709, 9 for BT.2020, 11
and 12 for the two P3 variants, 0 without a colour description; the
transfer characteristics and matrix of the stream do not change it),
while iris_hfi_gen1_read_changed_params() decodes the value as the
packed gen2 layout and finds no video_signal_type_present flag. The
SC8280XP gen1 decoder therefore reports the V4L2 defaults with or
without this change, and the change is only compile-tested. Other gen1
platforms were not checked.

Fixes: 84e17adae3e3 ("media: iris: add support for dynamic resolution change")
Origin: local
Upstream-Status: Pending
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_common.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_common.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_common.c
index aff27934c8..440c6176f7 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_common.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris/iris_hfi_common.c
@@ -27,8 +27,8 @@ u32 iris_hfi_get_v4l2_color_primaries(u32 hfi_primaries)
 		return V4L2_COLORSPACE_SMPTE240M;
 	case HFI_PRIMARIES_BT2020:
 		return V4L2_COLORSPACE_BT2020;
-	case V4L2_COLORSPACE_DCI_P3:
-		return HFI_PRIMARIES_SMPTE_RP431_2;
+	case HFI_PRIMARIES_SMPTE_RP431_2:
+		return V4L2_COLORSPACE_DCI_P3;
 	default:
 		return V4L2_COLORSPACE_DEFAULT;
 	}
